group features/cli
note callers <symbol>: who calls a symbol. Every symbol matching the name is listed, each followed by its callers. Callers live in other files, so indexing the symbol's own file would not find them; with a server the command asks for the symbol's incoming calls instead and maps each call site back to the symbol enclosing it. Without a server (the GUI's command line) the index's caller list is answered.

